# Files here are never uploaded to the edge, so they cannot be served at all.
#
# This is the right tool for keeping the build scripts off the web. The first
# attempt used a _redirects rule returning 404, which Cloudflare rejects:
# static assets only accept 200, 301, 302, 303, 307 and 308, so every deploy
# failed with "Invalid _redirects configuration" and three hours of fixes sat
# unshipped behind it.
#
# /data/ is deliberately NOT here: the dataset pages fetch their csv and json
# from it at runtime.
scripts/
.git/
